# Local private context. Keep public instructions and examples only.
**/private/*
!**/private/README.md
!**/private/*.example.md
**/private/assets/

# Local preferences, profiles, and secrets
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/personal-style.md
**/user-profile.md
**/brand-profile.md
**/candidate-profile.md
**/interview-history.md
**/project-context.md
**/subject-profile.md
**/*.local.md
.privacy-denylist

# Generated output
**/output/
**/dist/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Operating systems and editors
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
